---
import LegalPage from '../../components/pages/LegalPage.astro';
import Placeholder from '../../components/Placeholder.astro';
import { company, phoneLabel } from '../../data/company';
import { pagePath } from '../../i18n/ui';
---

<LegalPage lang="en" page="imprint" title="Legal notice">
  <p>
    This is a translation for convenience. The <a href={pagePath('imprint', 'de')} lang="de">German version (Impressum)</a> is legally
    binding.
  </p>

  <h2>Information pursuant to Section 5 DDG</h2>
  <p>
    {company.legalName}<br />
    {company.street}<br />
    {company.postalCode} {company.city}<br />
    Germany
  </p>

  <h2>Represented by</h2>
  <p>Managing director: {company.ceo}</p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>
    Phone: <a href={`tel:${company.phoneE164}`}>{phoneLabel('en')}</a><br />
    Email: <a href={`mailto:${company.email}`}>{company.email}</a>
  </p>

  <h2>Commercial register</h2>
  <p>
    Registered in the commercial register (Handelsregister)<br />
    Register court: <Placeholder>local court – to be added</Placeholder><br />
    Registration number: <Placeholder>HRB – to be added</Placeholder>
  </p>

  <h2>VAT ID</h2>
  <p>
    VAT identification number pursuant to Section 27a of the German VAT Act:<br />
    <Placeholder>DE – to be added</Placeholder>
  </p>

  <h2>Licence pursuant to Section 34a GewO</h2>
  <p>
    Licence for the security business pursuant to Section 34a of the German Trade Regulation Act (Gewerbeordnung).<br />
    Supervisory authority: <Placeholder>authority and address – to be added</Placeholder>
  </p>

  <h2>Responsible for content pursuant to Section 18 (2) MStV</h2>
  <p>
    {company.ceo}<br />
    {company.street}, {company.postalCode} {company.city}, Germany
  </p>

  <h2>Consumer dispute resolution</h2>
  <p>We are neither willing nor obliged to participate in dispute resolution proceedings before a consumer arbitration board.</p>

  <h2>Liability for content</h2>
  <p>
    The content of this website has been created with the utmost care. However, we cannot guarantee that it is accurate, complete or up
    to date. As a service provider, we are responsible for our own content on these pages in accordance with general law.
  </p>

  <h2>Liability for links</h2>
  <p>
    This website contains links to external third-party websites whose content we have no control over. The respective provider or
    operator is always responsible for the content of linked pages. If we become aware of any legal violations, we will remove such
    links immediately.
  </p>

  <h2>Copyright</h2>
  <p>
    The content and works published on this website are subject to German copyright law. Any reproduction, editing, distribution or use
    beyond the limits of copyright law requires the written consent of {company.legalName}.
  </p>
</LegalPage>
